    "16.49": "v16.49: same coplanar geometry as v16.48, rebuilt as one out-pattern sketch + one join extrude and one in-pattern sketch + one cut (clip; land the same per A/B half). Nested rings in one sketch rejected — overlapping hexes are sibling faces, not holes. Side Technic unchanged.",
